Copyright 2026 Gabriel Quintáns Souto (mixx86) and the Hivepal contributors

This product is a modified version of agentring (https://github.com/mutonby/agentring),
Copyright the agentring authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from agentring: a multi-agent relay (agents with their own keys, per-agent conversations,
groups, agent-to-agent conversations, quick replies, attachments, relay-sent reminders that insist,
wake-up emails, subscriptions), voice-note transcripts and text-to-speech, the matching CLI commands,
a redesigned bilingual Android app (drawer, Markdown, search, widget, subscriptions read in-app),
installer scripts, and the Hivepal name and icon.
